.TH KKTYPR 1 "November 2026" "kktypr 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
kktypr \- Terminal touch typing academy and developer syntax trainer
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B kktypr
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B kktypr
is a terminal touch typing tutor and developer syntax trainer written in Rust (Edition 2024) using Ratatui and Crossterm.
It features stationary cursor layout drills, dual structured curricula (Fundamentals and Developer Code Syntax), real-time keystroke accuracy and WPM metrics, weak-key heatmap analysis, targeted remediation drills, and a Word Drop arcade mode.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help information and exit.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version information and exit.
.SH CONTROLS
.TP
\fBEsc\fR
Return to previous menu or pause/exit active typing session.
.TP
\fBTab\fR / \fBShift-Tab\fR
Switch active view tabs or toggle options.
.TP
\fBArrow Keys\fR / \fBh, j, k, l\fR
Navigate menus, lessons, and profile entries.
.TP
\fBEnter\fR / \fBSpace\fR
Select lesson, confirm action, or restart drill.
.TP
\fBCtrl-c\fR
Safely exit application and restore terminal raw mode.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fI~/.local/share/kktypr/profiles.json\fR
Multi-profile persistence containing user accuracy heatmaps, lifetime WPM records, and completed exercise history.
